"Given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n$f(x) = \\frac{e^{-\\mid x/2 \\mid}}{4}, x ∈ (- ∞, ∞)$,\nits cumulative distribution function is\n$F(x) = {\\frac{e^{x/2}}{2},\\begin{vmatrix}x < 0 \\\\ h(x),\\end{vmatrix}x \\ge 0$.\nFind the function $h(x)$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134541 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "19449960-eb0d-5a46-a0bc-2a9ba0310c4e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134578 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186134579 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134578 #edb/ref 1061 132590 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134578 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3f773be7-dfa4-524f-aec7-8ade124c5cea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134578 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186135186 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134579 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186134580 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134579 #edb/ref 1061 132591 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134579 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2411aa47-0b30-5e9c-b541-4d44b5f7aeed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134579 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186133726 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134580 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186134581 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134580 #edb/ref 1061 132594 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134580 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "f242a3a5-626f-54b6-b0cc-b8af4506a3f0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134580 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186133727 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134581 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186134582 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134581 #edb/ref 1061 132597 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134581 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a74ce991-870f-5bfa-8a96-8bbed06ce5b6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134581 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186135187 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134582 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186134583 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134582 #edb/ref 1061 132598 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134582 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "47bc1334-f06b-5cc0-b191-427d1d862db4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186134582 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186133728 #edb/ref 175921